Notes for other lanes: L1 now exposes `playback.currentState`, `playback.timeSeconds`, `playback.durationSeconds` as accessor getters (spyOn-able), plus a `liveData` observable mirroring `[timeSeconds, durationSeconds]`. `skipTo` seeks via `findByTime`/`getLengthTo` and stops the previous chunk unconditionally. L2's `<SeekBar playback={playback}/>` can read `liveData` and call `playback.skipTo(seconds)`. L4's `duration` (seconds) maps to `playback.durationSeconds` and `LengthChanged` (ms) → `/1000`.

